Mix @sugar{115%g}, @flour{155%g}, @oats{40%g}, @salt{0.5%ml} in a bowl.

Add @butter{130%g} and mix until the mixture becomes whole.

Cut @apples{3} into thin slices and place them on a #26cm baking dish{} evenly.

Cover the apples with @sugar{2%tablespoons} and @cinnamon{as appropriate}, then sprinkle the mixture in crumbs.

Bake in #oven{} at 180°C for 27 minutes or until the top is golden brown.
